   "reference": "simulate every operation: pick the largest available value, then rewrite the state string by the unblocking rule",
   "candidate_design": "index i becomes available before operation d(i) + 1, where d(i) is its distance to the nearest \"1\" at or to its left; bucket values by d, then S[t] is the running maximum over buckets 0..t",
